&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Ability to build a well reasoned product strategy independently, without needing a dedicated research or strategy function to get there&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience advocating for merchants, with a track record of translating their everyday problems into practical product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
